      "content": "i checked the schedules and there are NO routines set up. i literally went through every single automation and nothing is scheduled for 11pm. it's like someone is bypassing the app or logging in and then deleting the trace. if my ex has my old credentials or found a way into my wifi, how would they do it without leaving a log in the standard settings? can you help me figure out if there's a way to track where these commands are coming from?",
